<main id="main">
<section class="case-hero"><a class="back-link" href={withBase('#work')}>← All work</a><p class="eyebrow">CASE 04 / BUSINESS DESIGN · STAKEHOLDER ALIGNMENT</p><h1>Creating shared direction for a new logistics business.</h1><p class="case-intro">A logistics business established by Braskem was shaping how it would manage vessels, work with its founding client and offer services to external customers. The early challenge was to bring leadership and teams into the same conversation about how the business would operate.</p><div aria-label="Case at a glance" class="quick-read"><div><span class="quick-label">Challenge</span><p>Establish how a new logistics business will work across teams and customers.</p></div><div><span class="quick-label">Contribution</span><p>Bring leadership and operational teams into a shared strategy conversation.</p></div><div><span class="quick-label">Delivered</span><p>Ownership maps, strategic analysis and value-versus-effort priorities.</p></div></div><div class="case-metadata"><div><span>CONTEXT</span><p>Braskem · New logistics business</p></div><div><span>MY FOCUS</span><p>Strategy, discovery &amp; facilitation</p></div><div><span>SCOPE</span><p>Leadership &amp; cross-functional alignment</p></div><div><span>TIMEFRAME</span><p>8-hour workshop · Netherlands</p></div></div></section><div class="case-cover source-cover"><button aria-label="Enlarge: Value proposition canvas" class="image-open laptop-frame" data-caption="Value proposition canvas" type="button"><img alt="Value proposition canvas" data-source-index="121" draggable="false" loading="eager" src={withBase('assets/source-121.webp')}/><span aria-hidden="true">Expand ↗</span></button></div>
<nav aria-label="Case sections" class="case-nav"><a href="#challenge">At a glance</a><a href="#decisions">The story</a><a href="#outcomes">Outputs &amp; outcomes</a></nav><div class="case-content">
<section class="challenge" id="challenge"><p class="eyebrow">THE BUSINESS QUESTION</p><h2>How should a new business connect its teams, customer relationships and growth priorities?</h2><div class="contribution"><div><h3>My contribution</h3><p>The work brought business strategy into a collaborative setting: surfacing roadblocks and dependencies, examining customer needs, separating certainties from assumptions, and organising opportunities by value and effort.</p></div><div><h3>Collaboration</h3><p>14 participants, including leadership and representatives from Sales, Product Management, Marketing and Logistics.</p></div></div><div class="facts"><div><strong>14</strong><span>workshop participants</span></div><div><strong>8h</strong><span>cross-functional workshop</span></div><div><strong>2</strong><span>working perspectives: enable &amp; grow</span></div></div></section><div id="decisions">
<section class="chapter story-stage" id="decision-1"><p class="chapter-index">01 / DECISION</p><div><h2>Make dependencies and ownership visible</h2><p class="decision-summary">Expose the responsibilities and dependencies that the business needs to resolve.</p><details class="decision-context"><summary>Read the decision context <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>Cross-functional groups explored what each area did, where it depended on others and which roadblocks affected the business. Ownership mapping made relationships and questions visible at an early stage, when the operating model was still being established.</p></details><blockquote>Growth required a shared understanding of how the organisation would work.</blockquote></div></section>
<section aria-label="Enablers and growth workstreams" class="slide-deck wide-image" data-deck=""><div class="deck-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE PROJECT</p><h2>Enablers and growth workstreams</h2></div><div class="deck-controls"><button aria-controls="source-deck-1" aria-label="Previous slide" data-deck-prev="" type="button">←</button><span aria-live="polite" data-deck-status="">1 / 2</span><button aria-controls="source-deck-1" aria-label="Next slide" data-deck-next="" type="button">→</button></div></div><div aria-label="Enablers and growth workstreams. Use arrow keys or drag with the mouse." class="deck-track" id="source-deck-1" role="region" tabindex="0">
