<section class="chapter story-stage" id="decision-2"><p class="chapter-index">02 / DECISION</p><div><h2>Connect the offer to customers and uncertainty</h2><p class="decision-summary">Separate customer needs, known constraints and untested assumptions.</p><details class="decision-context"><summary>Read the decision context <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>Value Proposition Canvas work explored customer activities, pains and gains. SWOT supported discussion of the existing business, while Certainties, Assumptions and Questions helped the growth group expose what still needed to be tested.</p></details><blockquote>Different levels of certainty called for different next steps.</blockquote></div></section>
<figure class="story-image wide-image"><div class="artifact-heading"><p class="eyebrow">PROJECT EVIDENCE</p><h3>Ownership mapping</h3></div><button aria-label="Enlarge: Ownership mapping" class="image-open" data-caption="Ownership mapping" type="button"><img alt="Ownership mapping" data-source-index="124" draggable="false" loading="lazy" src={withBase('assets/source-124.webp')}/><span aria-hidden="true">Expand ↗</span></button><figcaption>Select the image to explore the detail.</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="story-image wide-image"><div class="artifact-heading"><p class="eyebrow">PROJECT EVIDENCE</p><h3>Business group canvases</h3></div><button aria-label="Enlarge: Business group canvases" class="image-open" data-caption="Business group canvases" type="button"><img alt="Business group canvases" data-source-index="125" draggable="false" loading="lazy" src={withBase('assets/source-125.webp')}/><span aria-hidden="true">Expand ↗</span></button><figcaption>Select the image to explore the detail.</figcaption></figure>
<section class="chapter story-stage" id="decision-3"><p class="chapter-index">03 / DECISION</p><div><h2>Turn the conversation into priorities</h2><p class="decision-summary">Organise the opportunities into clearer next decisions.</p><details class="decision-context"><summary>Read the decision context <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>A value-versus-effort matrix helped organise opportunities and discuss quick wins alongside longer-term work. The outputs provided a basis for the next internal planning steps, rather than a claim that the full strategy had already been implemented.</p></details><blockquote>Alignment is useful when it makes the next decisions clearer.</blockquote></div></section>
